cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below and cite the accompanying article."
type: software
title: "GoNext: Transpiler and Reproducibility Package"
abstract: >-
  GoNext is an experimental dialect of Go and a six-stage source-to-source
  transpiler that implements high-level language extensions (enums with
  associated data, pattern matching, named and default arguments, extension
  methods, generic methods, short anonymous functions and uniform function
  call syntax) by lowering them to ordinary Go, keeping full compatibility
  with the Go compiler, runtime and ecosystem. The package also contains the
  micro-experiments, criterion scores, raw benchmark output and analysis
  scripts of the accompanying article.
authors:
